    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Emerald Caravan, fulfill the dream of becoming a caravan master and restore family business!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/64b598239b89af68b77f3be04385a49a.avif?t=1728923116\" data-has-big width=800 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is filled with magic as much as it is with mysteries \u2013 many use the power of crystals to fuel their machines, however none seems to know how exactly they work. During your adventures, you\u2019ll explore treacherous dungeons and find yourself in the middle of the unbelievable events hidden deep in the chambers. Craft items with the loot you\u2019ve found and manage your mobile store in order to expand your business. Keep your eyes open and uncover more secrets as you travel the land. Who\u2019s responsible for your family's caravan fall and how can you bring them to justice? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/f84f264e56fb9979600db45529b7d50d.poster.avif?t=1728923116\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/f84f264e56fb9979600db45529b7d50d.webm?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/f84f264e56fb9979600db45529b7d50d.mp4?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel the land far and wide, you\u2019ll eventually meet new friendly townsfolk. Win their affection by fulfilling their quests and who knows \u2013 some of them might even join you in your adventures! Cultivate your new friendships as your companions share a great knowledge of the world around you that might come in handy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/9b89573cdf8a0f61269c8c60176f4722.poster.avif?t=1728923116\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/9b89573cdf8a0f61269c8c60176f4722.webm?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/9b89573cdf8a0f61269c8c60176f4722.mp4?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Fight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not here only to make friends. It\u2019s high time to visit the dungeons! Once you\u2019re there, enhance your fighting abilities with various skills and randomized spells. Defeat the enemies and gather resources to sell and craft unique items with the help of your travel companions. That will keep clients interested in visiting your shop and all that money flowing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/2d05226b6df52b3a886e2ccaeae3fcb1.poster.avif?t=1728923116\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/2d05226b6df52b3a886e2ccaeae3fcb1.webm?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/2d05226b6df52b3a886e2ccaeae3fcb1.mp4?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Trade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your business with you everywhere you go, thanks to a mobile shop inside your caravan cart. Display items, set prices and serve your customers. Adjust to your clientele\u2019s needs and tastes as they will vary across different regions. Keep the customers satisfied and they will surely come for more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/97ed0255b9c7a4061aefbcc70e7d3dd8.poster.avif?t=1728923116\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/97ed0255b9c7a4061aefbcc70e7d3dd8.webm?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/97ed0255b9c7a4061aefbcc70e7d3dd8.mp4?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world everything is not as it seems. Your family business collapse wasn\u2019t just an accident and to prove it you\u2019ll need to gather credible evidence and find the culprit. Some of the dungeons are filled with strange technology and an invisible string somehow ties it to caravan\u2019s early demise. Nothing is lost, as you can still restore your family's good name \u2013 how you\u2019l do it is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/96cba87643232df494fa29f3936ec0ec.poster.avif?t=1728923116\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/96cba87643232df494fa29f3936ec0ec.webm?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/96cba87643232df494fa29f3936ec0ec.mp4?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Magicpunk</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Emerald Caravan sorcery and technology slowly meld into one. Artificers experiment with fueling machines with enchanted crystals that can be found deep in the mountains, however none had discovered how exactly their power works yet. Maybe you\u2019ll be the one to make a breakthrough in magic studies?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join Emerald Caravan, fulfill the dream of becoming a caravan master and restore family business!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/64b598239b89af68b77f3be04385a49a.avif?t=1728923116\" data-has-big width=800 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world is filled with magic as much as it is with mysteries \u2013 many use the power of crystals to fuel their machines, however none seems to know how exactly they work. During your adventures, you\u2019ll explore treacherous dungeons and find yourself in the middle of the unbelievable events hidden deep in the chambers. Craft items with the loot you\u2019ve found and manage your mobile store in order to expand your business. Keep your eyes open and uncover more secrets as you travel the land. Who\u2019s responsible for your family's caravan fall and how can you bring them to justice? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/f84f264e56fb9979600db45529b7d50d.poster.avif?t=1728923116\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/f84f264e56fb9979600db45529b7d50d.webm?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/f84f264e56fb9979600db45529b7d50d.mp4?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you travel the land far and wide, you\u2019ll eventually meet new friendly townsfolk. Win their affection by fulfilling their quests and who knows \u2013 some of them might even join you in your adventures! Cultivate your new friendships as your companions share a great knowledge of the world around you that might come in handy.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/9b89573cdf8a0f61269c8c60176f4722.poster.avif?t=1728923116\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/9b89573cdf8a0f61269c8c60176f4722.webm?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/9b89573cdf8a0f61269c8c60176f4722.mp4?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Fight</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re not here only to make friends. It\u2019s high time to visit the dungeons! Once you\u2019re there, enhance your fighting abilities with various skills and randomized spells. Defeat the enemies and gather resources to sell and craft unique items with the help of your travel companions. That will keep clients interested in visiting your shop and all that money flowing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/2d05226b6df52b3a886e2ccaeae3fcb1.poster.avif?t=1728923116\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/2d05226b6df52b3a886e2ccaeae3fcb1.webm?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/2d05226b6df52b3a886e2ccaeae3fcb1.mp4?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Trade</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your business with you everywhere you go, thanks to a mobile shop inside your caravan cart. Display items, set prices and serve your customers. Adjust to your clientele\u2019s needs and tastes as they will vary across different regions. Keep the customers satisfied and they will surely come for more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/97ed0255b9c7a4061aefbcc70e7d3dd8.poster.avif?t=1728923116\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/97ed0255b9c7a4061aefbcc70e7d3dd8.webm?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/97ed0255b9c7a4061aefbcc70e7d3dd8.mp4?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Mystery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world everything is not as it seems. Your family business collapse wasn\u2019t just an accident and to prove it you\u2019ll need to gather credible evidence and find the culprit. Some of the dungeons are filled with strange technology and an invisible string somehow ties it to caravan\u2019s early demise. Nothing is lost, as you can still restore your family's good name \u2013 how you\u2019l do it is up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/96cba87643232df494fa29f3936ec0ec.poster.avif?t=1728923116\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/96cba87643232df494fa29f3936ec0ec.webm?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2689710/extras/96cba87643232df494fa29f3936ec0ec.mp4?t=1728923116\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Magicpunk</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Emerald Caravan sorcery and technology slowly meld into one. Artificers experiment with fueling machines with enchanted crystals that can be found deep in the mountains, however none had discovered how exactly their power works yet. Maybe you\u2019ll be the one to make a breakthrough in magic studies?</p>",
